{"id": "jj-community-resource-grant-debarment", "title": "A COVID outreach subgrant and the false claims that led to J&J’s five-year ban", "seconds": 50.9, "voice": "elevenlabs:OtHu0lbpdNTqJVqaxDtR", "narrator": "Maven", "made": "2026-11-25", "key": "9c93a86c3b86c675", "words": 163, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The City Attorney examined six catering invoices submitted by J and J Community Resource Center.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.0, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Who", "provided", "the", "meals?"], "sub": "Outreach grant invoices"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.38, 0.74, 1.19, 1.46, 1.89, 2.45, 2.87, 3.03, 3.28, 3.4, 3.65, 4.08, 4.47]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Each invoice was for 3,000 dollars. The caterer said it provided no meals under the grant.", "t0": 5.12, "t1": 9.6, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "counts", "kicker": "San Francisco City Attorney", "text": "Six catering invoices", "mark": "Six catering invoices"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.27, 0.67, 0.8, 0.93, 1.14, 1.44, 2.21, 2.36, 2.8, 2.97, 3.04, 3.43, 3.59, 3.83, 4.02, 4.11]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The City Attorney reported 81,111 dollars improperly received through a COVID outreach subgrant.", "t0": 9.72, "t1": 15.46, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$81,111", "label": "Improperly received according to City Attorney"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.38, 0.72, 1.18, 1.63, 2.12, 2.32, 2.6, 2.9, 3.38, 3.94, 4.34, 4.55, 4.61, 4.93, 5.28]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The catering invoices were part of that amount.", "t0": 15.58, "t1": 17.38, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Part of the receipt total"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.47, 0.9, 1.03, 1.19, 1.26, 1.4]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The City Attorney said J and J sought at least 100,000 dollars across City programs.", "t0": 17.5, "t1": 21.85, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$100,000", "label": "At least this much sought across programs"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.35, 0.68, 0.87, 1.1, 1.22, 1.47, 1.69, 1.77, 2.03, 2.25, 2.49, 2.81, 3.13, 3.42, 3.65]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Other receipts included bourbon and motorcycle rentals. The Human Rights Commission did not pay them.", "t0": 21.97, "t1": 26.78, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "counts", "kicker": "San Francisco City Attorney", "text": "Unpaid receipts", "mark": "Unpaid receipts"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.29, 0.72, 1.14, 1.53, 1.65, 2.23, 3.04, 3.21, 3.47, 3.72, 4.1, 4.23, 4.39, 4.59]}, {"scene": "decision", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[2]", "established[4]"], "text": "J and J said the invoices reflected cash payments.", "t0": 27.0, "t1": 29.48, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "decision", "kicker": "San Francisco Office of the Controller", "text": "Hearing decision", "mark": "Hearing decision"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.31, 0.54, 0.7, 0.82, 1.28, 1.71, 1.97]}, {"scene": "decision", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[2]", "established[4]"], "text": "The hearing officer credited the vendors and excluded ambiguous invoices.", "t0": 29.6, "t1": 33.21, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Independent confirmations"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.39, 0.79, 1.2, 1.32, 1.76, 1.91, 2.4, 2.92]}, {"scene": "decision", "kind": "record", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "The hearing officer found willful misconduct by the nonprofit and LeAndrew Jenkins.", "t0": 33.33, "t1": 37.05, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "Five-year bar", "heading": "Who the order covered", "source": "decision", "rows": [{"icon": "decision", "label": "J&J", "value": "Debarred"}, {"icon": "decision", "label": "LeAndrew Jenkins", "value": "Debarred"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "Susan Murphy", "value": "No bar"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.36, 0.71, 0.93, 1.25, 1.82, 1.94, 2.04, 2.59, 2.71, 3.09]}, {"scene": "decision", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "Their five-year bar on City work runs through February 2029.", "t0": 37.17, "t1": 40.78, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "list", "kicker": "City and County of San Francisco", "text": "February 2029", "mark": "February 2029"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.61, 0.91, 1.04, 1.29, 1.7, 1.97, 2.24, 2.76, 3.03]}, {"scene": "decision", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[3]"], "text": "The City failed to prove its allegations against Susan Murphy. She was not barred.", "t0": 40.9, "t1": 44.8, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "decision", "kicker": "San Francisco Office of the Controller", "text": "Separate ruling on Murphy", "mark": "Separate ruling on Murphy"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.41, 0.71, 0.79, 1.0, 1.12, 1.66, 1.9, 2.2, 2.96, 3.14, 3.29, 3.47]}, {"scene": "decision", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "The amount ultimately recovered by the City remains unknown.", "t0": 44.92, "t1": 47.76, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Recovery"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.43, 0.94, 1.28, 1.4, 1.51, 1.99, 2.35]}, {"scene": "decision", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 47.88, "t1": 50.02, "shot": "r12", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.65, 0.8, 1.06, 1.17, 1.26, 1.5, 1.76]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The catering invoices", "decision": "The administrative hearing"}, "look": "map", "hook": "person"}